    "version": "1.0",
    "description": "Hypergraph ontology derived from the provided biology text. Nodes can have multiple categories. Hyperedges can connect 2+ nodes to encode n-ary relations (e.g., \"property-of-life\", \"level-of-organization\", \"taxonomic-membership\", \"ethical-case\").",
